      "text": "The function W is differentiable, and W(t) gives the depth of water in a rain barrel, in centimeters, at time t hours. Selected values of W(t) are given in the table. Using the average rate of change of W over the interval \\( 2 \\le t \\le 9 \\), approximate \\( W'(7) \\). Give the exact value of the approximation and indicate units of measure.",
